<div class="wrap">
  <section>
    <h2>About</h2>
    <p>
      <em>Wirtschaft neu lesen</em> ("Reading economics anew") brings together a podcast, a newsletter and
      conversations around recent economics books from German-speaking authors. We review books, check their sources and talk with
      the authors about their ideas, theses and analyses. The reading list currently has about 17 titles,
      and the project is just getting started.
    </p>
  </section>

